<title>FRANCE: French customs seize counterfeit Disney items.</title>
<headline>French customs seize counterfeit Disney items.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS</dateline>
<text>
<p>French customs agents recently seized 12 tonnes of counterfeit Walt Disney bed linen in a container arriving by sea from the United States, Budget Minister Alain Lamassoure said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lamassoure said a separate 13-tonne shipment of over 65,000 Chinese-made teddy bears, each bearing the counterfeit trademark of another American toy manufacturer, which was not identified, was also seized.</p>
</text>
